        "id": "26679",
        "name": "Massive New Krew - Kill 'Em All",
        "description": "From EP \"Reborn\", 2022. I heard it. I map it.\n\nSwing eBPM: 185.00\n\nTech map, yes. Drop patterns are experimental, rest is standard. I'm honestly conflicted if the last drop pattern is too much of a diffspike. Please mind your controllers and don't take this one too seriously if it doesn't work. Testplays by yours truly again, so mapper blindness is to be expected.\n\nReup 1: Adjusted one section to hopefully lead-in better and not start with left hand. Old leaderboard: https://scoresaber.com/leaderboard/468458\n\nLights with Lolighter.",
