        "id": "3312a",
        "name": "Firestarter VIP - Tanger",
        "description": "FI-RE-STAR-TER.\n\nMap is best played with \"All Effects\" turned on!\n\nYoutube Preview- https://www.youtube.com/watch/OjczCywoPyU\nZen Mode Preview- Soon\n\nSong Sauce- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vgqb_OaSeMw&pp=ygUPZmlyZXN0YXJ0ZXIgdmlw\n\nMap will not work on 1.20 (OST 5) or below! Recommended play version is 1.29.1 (modded) or 1.30 (unmodded) on PC, or 1.28 on Quest\n\nATTENTION 1.28 QUEST USERS- From what I have tried, having chroma installed disables all Z-Axis Translations! For the best looking lightshow, temporarily disable Chroma in BMBF.\n\nScores will only upload to BeatLeader because of arcs and chains!\n\nColour Set- Weave\n\nEnvironment- Weave\n\nFULLY mapped and lit beatmap using beat saber's official 3D editor!\n\nAny issues, hit me up @FeudBoy_YT#6701",
