        "description": "My second proper map! I am very happy with it.\n\nIt is pretty balanced, and has some 294 BPM bits. \nFeaturing hella walls and no lights!\n8.5-9.5 stars?\n----------\nIt's interesting finishing a map then seeing how other people mapped the same song. Crazy how differently people can map the same audio. \nMy mapping is obviously the best of all the maps, though. \n;)\nLet me know if there's anything I should change, as I'm the only person who has playtested this. Discord: \"ruzalda\"",
