        "description": "From album \"PLEiADES\", 2018. There's a newer mastering of the track, but I prefer this colder one.\r\n\r\nI went with the obvious map route with this one, no pushing the envelope here. With some tracks you just feel the movements when listening, this is easily one of those. Some melodies are consistently undermapped, hopefully it doesn't feel off. Also contains my first released arc, hooray confetti.\r\n\r\nLights with lolighter.",
