        "id": "42061",
        "name": "FAKE TYPE. - Masquerade",
        "description": "Thank you so much to @NTS-Azazel for inviting me to make a map for their awesome lightshow! I've been wanting to map more FAKE TYPE. ever since discovering their music when choosing something to make for the Electro Swing World Tour pack, and this was a perfect opportunity to do so!\n\nThis map has quite a bit of tech in it, but I hope it plays well! I did test an early version of this but quite a bit has changed and I wasn't able to test this version as I was away from home when it needed to be posted, but feedback is always appreciated!\n\nLightshow preview here: https://youtu.be/RMPPsG3ebVc",
