        "description": "Song ! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CgCVZdcKcqY\n--------------\n🚨 WARNING! 🚨\nThis map contains extremely difficult patterns, including after-sliders, 180° tech, bomb resets, and jump walls.\nProceed only if you're ready to suffer. Not recommended for the faint of heart.\n\nRemember to jump. 🦘\nThis map also includes Chroma lighting, so make sure you have the Chroma mod installed for the full experience.\n⚠️ Sorry, this map does not include any difficulty below Hard.\n\nThat said, each difficulty is uniquely designed with creativity and care — not just hard, but fun and expressive.\n\nYou've been warned. 💀\n\n🙏 Special thanks to:\nJonas\nTonkie\nDanny \n--\nExpertPlus ⭐ 9.54\nExpert ⭐ 8.82\nHard ⭐ 7.38\nNormal ⭐ 6.31\nEasy ⭐ 4.09",
