        "name": "[V3] Caffeine - RWBY Volume 2 (2025 Remap)",
        "description": "I remapped Caffeine, which was the fourth map I've ever released. Due to that, the mapping is quite simple and it's also the wrong bpm so the guitar solo is a bit slower than usual. I think I should've fixed all that by now.  Also it was autolit, now it's manually lit using v3 lights!\n\nDifficulties\nExpert+: @psychicpineapple\nExpert: @psychicpineapple\nNormal: @Spartplat\nEasy: @Spartplat\n\nThank you @ZeCube and @Delta_984 for playtesting as well!\nVideo -> https://youtu.be/JPp00EMGXug",
